    {
      "id": "p0016-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "If you're unfamiliar with translation, this idea probably sounds odd at first. Why should anything be changed at all? Shouldn't a literal translation work all the time? Let's find out.",
        "raw": "If you're unfamiliar with translation, this idea probably sounds odd at first.\nWhy should anything be changed at all? Shouldn't a literal translation work all\nthe time? Let's find out.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2916593,
          0.25650714,
          0.89010973,
          0.30531429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28458362,
          0.25579286,
          0.90030881,
          0.30638571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          9,
          10,
          11
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "如果你不熟悉翻译，乍听之下可能觉得奇怪。为什么要改？难道不是任何时候都能直译吗？我们来看看。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
