    {
      "id": "p0016-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Imagine you're talking to a grumpy genie who takes everything literally. You want to be rich, so you immediately wish to be \"made of money\". Unfortunately, instead of becoming rich, you transform into a pile of coins. Oops, that's not what you meant at all!",
        "raw": "Imagine you're talking to a grumpy genie who takes everything literally.\nYou want to be rich, so you immediately wish to be \"made of money\".\nUnfortunately, instead of becoming rich, you transform into a pile of coins.\nOops, that's not what you meant at all!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29119433,
          0.35738571,
          0.86150379,
          0.42372143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28458362,
          0.35667143,
          0.90030881,
          0.42479286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          13,
          14,
          15,
          16
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "设想你遇到一个暴躁、凡事照字面理解的精灵。你想发财，立刻许愿让自己 made of money（富得流油，字面为“由钱构成”）。结果却变成了一堆硬币。哎呀，这可不是你想要的！",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
