    {
      "id": "p0016-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "\"Ugh, whatever! I just wish I had lots of dough!\" you somehow say. You expect to become rich for sure this time, but instead, you suddenly find yourself covered in bread dough. Oops again!",
        "raw": "\"Ugh, whatever! I just wish I had lots of dough!\" you somehow say. You expect\nto become rich for sure this time, but instead, you suddenly find yourself\ncovered in bread dough. Oops again!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
