    {
      "id": "p0016-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "These examples, as ridiculous as they are, show how a literal interpretation can completely miss the point of what's being said.",
        "raw": "These examples, as ridiculous as they are, show how a literal interpretation can\ncompletely miss the point of what's being said.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2925286,
